<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>No person, other than a seller, shall sell or offer for sale a vehicle service contract to a purchaser.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>No obligor shall use a seller as a fronting company and no seller shall act as a fronting company.  For purposes of this section, a “fronting company” is a seller that authorizes a third-party obligor to use its name or business to evade or circumvent the provisions of subdivision (a).</p></caml:Content>